An '''arrestor cruiser'''<ref name="Daughter" />, or '''patrol and detainment cruiser'''<ref name="Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> was a type of [[cruiser]] that utilized powerful [[tractor beam projector]]s. The [[Cantwell-class Arrestor Cruiser|''Cantwell''-class 410 cruiser]] was a model of arrestor cruiser used by the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Daughter" />
